requency reference, so revised and renewed medication orders can offer the calculated quantity link after dosing edits.\n\nKeep preserved manual quantities sticky by only showing the recalculate link when the calculated quantity differs from the current quantity, and cover the existing-order flow with regression tests for REVISE and RENEW.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"b8d3fe2ea7a8546c4f4800029bdaec4f6423a8c8","date":"2026-05-26T01:48:12+05:30","message":"(feat) O3-5374: Add support for future medication start dates (#2973)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Tanishq Sangwan","authorEmail":"tanishqsangwan7@gmail.com"},{"hash":"33ae989b8a29fcee7e7fe8bba7ef153a4d583b12","date":"2026-05-12T20:23:01+03:00","message":"(fix) Floor medication order encounter datetime to visit start (#3300)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"e86881cbe9df9519bc23943224812974c2f878ac","date":"2026-05-12T00:42:18+03:00","message":"(fix) Align start date field size and clean up drug order form styles","refs":"","body":"Two related cleanups in the drug order form, surfaced while reviewing\nfollow-ups to PR #3198.\n\nStart date field sizing:\n- Switch the picker from size=\"lg\" to size=\"md\" on tablet so it lines\n  up with its sibling Duration unit combobox.\n- Drop the .fullWidthDatePickerContainer wrapper. It was intended to\n  make the input fill its lg={16} column, but Carbon's\n  max-width: 15rem on .cds--date-picker-input__wrapper silently capped\n  the width, so the override never took effect. The input has always\n  rendered at ~240px, which looks correct for a 10-character date, so\n  the workaround is removed rather than fixed.\n\nDead styles audit:\n- .backButton is defined in drug-order-form.scss but only referenced\n  from add-drug-order.component.tsx, which imports add-drug-order.scss\n  (where the same class is defined). The definition was a leftover\n  duplicate.\n- styles.button is applied to both buttons in the discard/save\n  ButtonSet, and styles.customElement is applied to the wrapper div in\n  CustomNumberInput, but neither class is defined anywhere. Both\n  resolved to undefined at runtime and applied no styling.\n\nNo visual change.\n","authorName":"denniskigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"770ee0bb40823a93f093e7dda57f8c5d131e8207","date":"2026-05-10T22:08:57+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-4444: Persist medication order start date (#3198)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Aditya Dwivedi","authorEmail":"aditdwivedi336@gmail.com"}],"totalCount":11}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e190269a-5a11-48e4-94d1-721dd43a3104","uuid":"42ee019d-4137-4241-b450-ce9f07fed2d6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T14:59:01.111Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"commits":[{"hash":"1c19126f11ca5bb93891bd18d89910d20f41ee84","date":"2026-10-12T23:24:09+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-6097: Fix inverted labels on the free text dosage toggle (#3793)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Sathieskumar Sudeshkar","authorEmail":"sudeshkar008sk@gmail.com"},{"hash":"f5539ea4c4101357388e5bd00678856073f4b4ae","date":"2026-10-05T21:21:10+03:00","message":"(fix) O3-6019: Preserve medication dosage drafts when switching modes (#3639)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"omeri innocent","authorEmail":"innocentomeri08@gmail.com"},{"hash":"2ef3f9eaee8f5c9e63fca29d48ea95b193261059","date":"2026-09-01T03:25:05+05:30","message":"(fix) O3-5908: Prevent duplicate orders from pinned drugs (#3596)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Abhay","authorEmail":"abhaynimbalkar03@gmail.com"},{"hash":"d623a03ff2839cb4c82bca935d48e5ecb4bcda94","date":"2026-07-24T16:40:55-04:00","message":"(feat) Order basket should try to rely on server-side dates (#3507)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"6ee20d3d570aeb80704210ec109619b8ffff82ba","date":"2026-06-25T13:17:32-04:00","message":"(fix) Fix size ali